      "message": "Merge main into issue/1610-open-shell-incomplete (geometry/import/mod.rs: keep both sides)\n\nmain turned STL and OBJ meshes outward in the graded loaders (mesh_outward);\nthe branch added Graded::open and the *_open loaders. The resolution keeps\nboth: the outward turn runs in the *_open loaders, and the graded loaders\nstill refuse a hole through whole().\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
